<title>UK: Helaba unit sets 250 mln swiss franc 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Helaba unit sets 250 mln swiss franc 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB, Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HELABA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE PLC, DUBLIN</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LB HESSEN THUERINGEN FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    22.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.90    PAY DATE    22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 S&amp;P	  AAA	 EOS	   04.JUL.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
